<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπονοστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go down, sink,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				367a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <i>settle,</i> of a stack of wood, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.62
			</span></i>; of the earth in an earthquake, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				365b12
			</span></i>; of a river, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἀνδρὶ ὡς ἐς μέσον μηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.191
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.366e
			</span></i>; of humours, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ βάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.254
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>settle, turn into</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς χλευασμὸν καὶ γέλωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.811e
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>sink, decline,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ φοβεροῦ ὑ. πρὸς τὸ
					εὐκαταφρόνητον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					3.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ μὴ ὄν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					440
				</span></i>
			; of the aged, <i>decline</i> in years, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.21
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
